      * CONTACT: one record per contact, keyed by contact number.
      * (Comment lines: an asterisk in position 7, no form type.)
     A          R RCONTACT                  TEXT('Contact')
     A            CTID           5S 0       TEXT('Contact number')
     A            CTNAME        30A         TEXT('Name')
     A            CTCITY        20A         TEXT('City')
     A            CTPHONE       15A         TEXT('Phone')
     A          K CTID
